## Substrate-adds (shipped within this slice)

1. **`/api/test/seed_roster` REST endpoint** — dispatches
   `OrchestratorAction::Roster(RosterAction::RosterMemberUpserted{...})`
   to the canonical orchestrator action chain so mirror.roster
   propagates to the renderer's state-snapshot. Gated by
   `BPMUX_TEST_SEED_API` env-var at the structural router boundary.
2. **`seedRoster` helper** in `test/fixtures/seedMessages.ts` —
   POSTs identity list to the new endpoint.
3. **RTL win.reload-equivalent** — `rendered.cleanup()` then a fresh
   `renderApp()`. No new substrate; just an idiomatic pattern.
   `window.localStorage.clear()` in afterEach so pill-state doesn't
   leak across cases.

